WEBVTT

00:08:27.079 --> 00:08:31.913
thinking about airflow before the advent
of HVAC or mechanical ventilation,

00:08:31.913 --> 00:08:35.537
they were thinking about how a building
is sited and oriented to capture

00:08:35.537 --> 00:08:37.246
and maintain and control as much

00:08:37.246 --> 00:08:39.621
as possible in order to
make people healthier.

00:08:39.912 --> 00:08:41.412
And we're thinking about
this all the time.

00:08:41.412 --> 00:08:43.787
I'm sure now you're thinking
about with the coronavirus,

00:08:43.787 --> 00:08:47.329
the tables that you're touching and the
spaces and, you know, handles here.

00:08:47.621 --> 00:08:50.746
And all of that is related to some degree,

00:08:50.746 --> 00:08:54.537
being spatially aware of what
is invisible around us.

00:08:55.246 --> 00:08:59.121
OK, so you you wrapped up that project
in Rwanda back in 2011.

00:08:59.371 --> 00:09:03.537
And since then, you have gone on to
build more hospitals and schools,